{
  "info": {
    "name": "realloc API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Ordem sugerida: (1) npm run seed:admin; (2) Auth > Login (admin); (3) Recruiters > Create recruiter (ativo) ou Auth > Register (recrutador) + Approve; (4) Auth > Register (realocado); (5) Auth > Login (realocado); (6) Recruiters > List available recruiters; (7) Relocated > Submit form. Os tokens e ids ficam nas variáveis da collection. O refresh token vive em cookie httpOnly (cookie jar do Postman); o accessToken dura 15 min: use Auth > Refresh."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3100"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "admin@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "change-me-please"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "outro.admin@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "secret123"
    },
    {
      "key": "recruiterEmail",
      "value": "rita@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "newRecruiterEmail",
      "value": "nova.recrutadora@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "recruiterPassword",
      "value": "secret123"
    },
    {
      "key": "relocatedEmail",
      "value": "rui@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "relocatedPassword",
      "value": "secret123"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "recruiterId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "relocatedId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register (cadastro de recrutador)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set('recruiterId', data.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/recruiter",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Público. A conta nasce INATIVA (active=false) e não recebe tokens: o login retorna 403 até um admin aprovar em 'Approve recruiter'. Limitado por IP (padrão 5 por hora).",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Nova Recrutadora\",\n  \"email\": \"{{newRecruiterEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{recruiterPassword}}\",\n  \"team\": \"Alpha\",\n  \"position\": \"Recrutadora\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register (cadastro de realocado)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
